{
  "description": "The image shows a single quadrupedal equine animal in right-facing side profile against a plain off-white background. The body is slender and donkey-like in proportions with a long neck, narrow torso, and thin legs, covered in short coarse hair that is light tan to gray-brown on the upper body and paler cream on the belly and lower legs. Dark brown to blackish striping overlays the coat on the neck, torso, hindquarters and legs. The head is held high, the tail hangs low at the rear, and all four legs are visible standing on a flat surface. The rendering is detailed and naturalistic, like a vintage zoological illustration.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "elongated equine head with a donkey-like profile, blunt muzzle with a white patch around the nostrils and mouth, dark nostril, small dark eye with a light ring, and slightly shaggy brown fur on the forehead and cheeks",
      "where": "at the front end of the neck, facing to the right"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two large, upright, pointed ears with dark outer edges and lighter inner fur, with dark shading inside the ear canal",
      "where": "on top of the head, one slightly in front of the other in side view"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "short, stiff, upright brush of dark brown and black hair with lighter tips, cut short and standing erect",
      "where": "along the dorsal midline of the neck from behind the ears to the shoulders"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four slender, straight equine legs with visible joints at knee and hock, covered in short hair that is pale on the lower portion and striped with dark transverse bands on the upper and lower segments",
      "where": "underneath the body, two forelegs beneath the chest and two hind legs beneath the hindquarters, with the left hind leg partially obscured behind the right hind leg"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "single dark hooves, rounded and solid, with a slight sheen at the tip",
      "where": "at the bottom tip of each of the four legs, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "thin, narrow tail with short hair at the base and a longer dark brown to black tuft of coarse hair at the tip",
      "where": "at the rear of the body, extending down from the rump and hanging vertically"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "dark brown to black transverse stripes of varying width and intensity, including a thin dark dorsal stripe along the spine, a vertical shoulder stripe, multiple angled stripes across the torso and hindquarters, and horizontal bands around the legs and lower neck",
      "where": "distributed across the neck, shoulders, back, sides, hindquarters, and all four legs, with the belly and muzzle remaining pale and unstriped"
    }
  ],
